        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Methodism, Church of England\n- People: John Wesley, Charles Wesley, George Whitefield\n- Roles: Anglican cleric, theologian\n\nFacts:\n- In the 18th century, Methodism originated as a revival within the Church of England.\n- John Wesley was born on 28 June 1703 (O.S. 17 June 1703).\n- John Wesley was an English Anglican cleric and theologian.\n- John Wesley, Charles Wesley, and George Whitefield founded Methodism.\n- Methodism became a separate denomination after John Wesley's death.\n- John Wesley died on 2 March 1791.",
